    <string name="contact_body">Developer: Santiago Perez Hernandez\nEmail: infogenpdf@gmail.com\n\nAbout the app\nGenInfor generates PDF reports with photos, stores them locally, and can send them by email.\n\nData collected\nNo personal data is collected for analytics or advertising.\n\nData storage\nReports and data are stored locally on the device.\n\nThird-party sharing\nNo commercial third-party sharing.\n\nContact\nFor any questions, email infogenpdf@gmail.com.\n\nData deletion\nYou can remove data from app settings or by uninstalling the app.</string>

    <string name="privacy_body">GenInfor\n\nLast updated: February 13, 2026\n\n1. Data controller\nName: Santiago Perez Hernandez\nContact email: infogenpdf@gmail.com\n\n2. Personal data processed\nThe app does not require sign-up and does not collect identifiers for commercial purposes.\nReport data entered by users is stored locally on the device.\n\n3. Purpose\nGenerate PDF intervention reports with attached photos.\n\n4. Legal basis\nVoluntary use of the app.\n\n5. Storage\nData is stored locally on the device.\n\n6. Third-party sharing\nNo advertising or analytics sharing.\n\n7. Permissions\nCamera/gallery may be used for photos, and internet is used only when email sending is requested.\n\n8. User rights and deletion\nData can be deleted from system settings, app settings menu, or by uninstalling the app.\n\n9. Policy updates\nThis policy may be updated for legal or functional changes.</string>
